/api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-03-10T02:30:42Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T20:49:56Z","closed_at":"2025-06-03T20:47:07Z","assignee":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\r\n\r\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.4.stable\r\n\r\n### System information\r\n\r\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - AMD Ryzen 7 7735HS with Radeon Graphics (16 threads)\r\n\r\n### Issue description\r\n\r\nUsing \"Detect from project\" in the engine compilation configuration editor causes the build to crash on launch. I detected from project, saved the `.build` file, then compiled Windows release templates using it. Exporting the MRP with that build makes it crash on launch with this error: \"Mainloop type doesn't exist: Scenetree\"\r\n\r\n![Clipboard - March 9, 2025](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bd739e37-cd2e-4ba3-9811-59f8b1f8f9a9)\r\n\r\n**This issue doesn't happen when I reset to the default settings then tick off the same nodes/resources manually**. Looking at the autogenerated `.build` file, we can clearly see the issue: it includes \"MainLoop\" in the list of disabled classes which Godot apparently needs to run. Removing it from the file fixes things... Sort of. \r\n\r\nThis should probably be its own separate issue, but it's worth noting in this same MRP, the autodetect feature fails to include other things the game needs to run. The game crashes on launch due to not having StyleBoxFlat: `ERROR: Class 'StyleBoxFlat' or its base class cannot be instantiated.` After removing StyleBox from the list of disabled classes, it now causes an error that it can't find KinematicCollision2D, which should definitely be included when 2D physics bodies exist in the project.\r\n\r\nThis thing is too overzealous in what it removes. I'm tired of fighting the build editor for one day 😪.\r\n\r\n[build_files.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19154423/build_files.zip)\r\n\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\nOpen up MRP, go to Project>Tools>Engine Compilation Configuration Editor\r\n\r\nClick on \"Detect from project\", then save as a new `.build` file\r\n\r\nTry compiling a release template and use it to export the MRP. The build created will fail to launch with the error mentioned above.\r\n\r\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\r\n\r\n[godot-size-test_2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19154431/godot-size-test_2.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103884/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103884/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}